 and she is frustrated every day."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c38845"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本編主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"サラリーマンの夫と、生意気盛りの息子（＝明）を持つ専業主婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生真面目な性格で、常識人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫との結婚初夜まで体を許さなかった潔癖さを持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在、夫とはセックスレス状態で、すっかり熟れた肉体を持て余し、欲求不満の日々が続いている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14498","sourceWorkId":"12991","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"サラリーマンの夫と、生意気盛りの息子を持つ、平凡な主婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いわゆる生真面目で常識人。夫とも結婚初夜まで身体を許さなかったという潔癖さを持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫とのセックスの減少にすっかり熟れた身体を持て余しており、欲求不満気味の毎日。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"138078"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/344b32dae73a65eff1c5f47b4cf763c1d03e5e623de474f7b81c49e0ce7f0b2d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/ad4de5b075f00ef5c1a21e8c36b9da0e260570d5f95f160db05ad7a5e64ddb42.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"峯香織","creatorId":"vndb:s20187","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s20187","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s20187","name":"峯香織","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:224103:138078:5481:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"和泉 あやか","creatorId":"vndb:s493","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s493","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s493","name":"和泉あやか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:19770","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c38846","characterName":"小倉 かすみ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"138080","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"224103"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14499"],"vndbCharacterId":"c38846"},"originalCharacterName":"小倉 かすみ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"pr